                            <h3 class="awsdocs-card-title">Get started with the AWS Glue Data Catalog</h3>
                            <div class="awsdocs-abstract">
              Use this tutorial to create your first AWS Glue Data Catalog, which uses an Amazon S3 bucket as your data source.             
            </div>
                        </a>
                    </article>
                    <article class="awsdocs-card">
                        <a href="/glue/latest/dg/add-crawler.html" class="awsdocs-card-link">
